Cited-References = {ARIAN A, 1989, J CONFLICT RESOLUT, V33, P605, DOI 10.1177/0022002789033004002.
   Arian A., 1993, The political psychology of the Gulf war: Leaders, publics and the process of conflict, P227, DOI {[}10.2307/j.ctv25m88qk.17, DOI 10.2307/J.CTV25M88QK.17].
